@guide A_Hillsbrad
@name Hillsbrad Foothills (Southshore)
@faction Alliance
@levels 28-31
@zone Hillsbrad Foothills
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Southshore quests: the coast, the Syndicate, the Crushridge ogres and the yetis. A short stop before Arathi.
@next A_Arathi

fp Southshore
bind Southshore
accept Down the Coast | Lieutenant Farren Orinelle, Southshore.
turnin 538 Southshore [optional]
accept Soothing Turtle Bisque | Chef Jessen.
accept Syndicate Assassins | Magistrate Henry Maleb, town hall.
accept Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak | Bartolo Ginsetti.
accept Costly Menace | Darren Malvew.
accept Crushridge Bounty | Marshal Redpath.
accept Hints of a New Plague? | Phin Odelic.
complete Down the Coast | Murlocs on the coast south of Southshore.
turnin Down the Coast
accept 559 Farren's Proof
complete Soothing Turtle Bisque | Snapjaws along the coast.
complete 559 Farren's Proof | Murloc heads from Torn Fin murlocs.
turnin Soothing Turtle Bisque
turnin 559 Farren's Proof
accept 560 Farren's Proof
turnin 560 Farren's Proof | Marshal Redpath.
accept 561 Farren's Proof
turnin 561 Farren's Proof
accept Stormwind Ho!
complete Stormwind Ho! | Daggerspine naga further south.
turnin Stormwind Ho!
accept Reassignment
turnin 474 Defeat Nek'rosh [optional]
turnin 292 The Eye of Paleth
accept 293 Cleansing the Eye [optional]
turnin 321 Lightforge Iron [optional]
accept 322 Blessed Arm [optional]
turnin 637 Sully Balloo's Letter
accept 683 Sara Balloo's Plea
turnin 683 Sara Balloo's Plea
accept 686 A King's Tribute
turnin 686 A King's Tribute
accept 9435 Missing Crystals
complete 9435 Missing Crystals
accept 510 Foreboding Plans
