accept 514 Letter to Stormpike [optional]
turnin 510 Foreboding Plans
turnin 9435 Missing Crystals
turnin 514 Letter to Stormpike [optional]
complete Syndicate Assassins | Syndicate camp north-east of Southshore (Durnholde area).
turnin Syndicate Assassins
complete Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak | Yetis in the Alterac foothills cave.
turnin Bartolo's Yeti Fur Cloak
complete Crushridge Bounty | Crushridge ogres north of Southshore.
turnin Crushridge Bounty
complete Costly Menace | Hillsbrad farms; kill the Syndicate.
turnin Costly Menace
complete Hints of a New Plague? | Forsaken courier on the road (patrols).
turnin Hints of a New Plague?
level 30
train | Ironforge via the Wetlands, or Stormwind by flight.
note Ride east past Durnholde into the Arathi Highlands; Refuge Pointe is the Alliance town.
